# Dependencies (installed from the public registry; never committed)
node_modules/

# Editor / OS noise
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo

# lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the built host half and the browser bundle
# are committed so `dsh plugin add github:...` works with no build step and no
# devDependencies on the consumer's machine. DSH serves lib/client.js as-is, so
# a missing bundle is a boot failure, not a build prompt. Re-run `pnpm build`
# and commit lib/ whenever src/ changes.

# Local working note: design lineage of the sibling plugin this one was modelled
# on, carrying machine-specific paths from this checkout. Kept out of history —
# README.md holds everything a reader needs.
REFERENCE.md
